{'symbol': 'BAX', 'date': '2021-12-13 19:20:00', 'title': 'ALCOA SET TO JOIN S&P MIDCAP 400', 'text': 'NEW YORK, DEC. 13, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0S&P DOW JONES INDICES WILL MAKE THE FOLLOWING CHANGES TO THE S&P MIDCAP 400: ALCOA CORP. (NYSE:AA) WILL REPLACE HILL-ROM HOLDINGS INC. (NYSE:HRC) IN THE S&P MIDCAP 400 EFFECTIVE PRIOR TO THE OPENING OF TRADING ON MONDAY, DECEMBER 20. S&P 500 CONSTITUENT BAXTER INTERNATIONAL INC. (NYSE: BAX) IS ACQUIRING HILL-ROM IN A DEAL THAT WAS COMPLETED TODAY.'}